coinbase-mcp-server (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Note: Build-Depends/Depends pin nodejs (>= 24) to match upstream's
    engines.node constraint. This is currently not satisfiable on
    Debian trixie or Ubuntu resolute, whose nodejs is 20.x; the
    Jenkinsfile keeps those distributions commented out until a newer
    nodejs is available there.

